# Ambient strain of the actual raw primary atom

The exact full-tensor residual in `app:ch_waves:eq:WKB-residual`, with the
actual projected frame, both complex quadratures and the original atom.
The retained frame threshold and Gram gap give the actual uniform Frobenius
inverse bound. The threshold must be included in the parent's common
reference neighborhood. The quantitative estimate differentiates the actual
inverse-Gram reconstruction from primitive jets and transfers the existing
reserve-fourteen correction budgets with the `rpar + 2` allowance. Its
constants precede the immersion, initial scalar, scale and frequency. The
parent applies these deductions on its single reference and finite family.
-/
